    <section class="faq-section"> 
  <div class="container">

     <div class="text-center mb-5">
        <h5 class="section-tag">FAQ</h5>
        <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions About AWS</h2>
        <p class="section-text">
           Find answers to common questions about Amazon Web Services and how it can help your business grow.
        </p>
     </div>

     <div class="faq-container">

        <!-- Q1 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
           <button type="button" class="faq-question">
              What is AWS and why should I use it for my business?
              <span class="icon">+</span>
           </button>
           <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                 Amazon Web Services (AWS) is a leading cloud computing platform that provides scalable, secure, 
                 and cost-effective infrastructure. It allows businesses to run applications, store data, and 
                 scale resources on demand without investing in physical hardware.
              </p>
           </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Q2 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
           <button type="button" class="faq-question">
              How secure is AWS cloud infrastructure?
              <span class="icon">+</span>
           </button>
           <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                 AWS offers enterprise-grade security with features like data encryption, identity access management (IAM), 
                 threat detection, and compliance certifications, ensuring your data remains safe and protected.
              </p>
           </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Q3 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
           <button type="button" class="faq-question">
              How much does AWS cost for small businesses?
              <span class="icon">+</span>
           </button>
           <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                 AWS follows a pay-as-you-go pricing model, meaning you only pay for what you use. Costs depend on your 
                 usage, but it is highly flexible and can be optimized to suit small and large businesses.
              </p>
           </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Q4 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
           <button type="button" class="faq-question">
              How long does AWS migration take?
              <span class="icon">+</span>
           </button>
           <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                 Migration timelines vary depending on the complexity of your infrastructure. Simple applications can be 
                 migrated within days, while enterprise systems may take several weeks.
              </p>
           </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Q5 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
           <button type="button" class="faq-question">
              Do you provide AWS support after deployment?
              <span class="icon">+</span>
           </button>
           <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                 Yes, we offer continuous monitoring, maintenance, and support services to ensure your AWS cloud 
                 infrastructure performs efficiently and scales with your business needs.
              </p>
           </div>
        </div>

     </div>

  </div> 
</section>
    <script>
    const faqItems = document.querySelectorAll(".faq-item");

    faqItems.forEach(item => {
        const btn = item.querySelector(".faq-question");

        btn.addEventListener("click", (e) => {
            e.preventDefault();

            faqItems.forEach(i => {
                if(i !== item){
                    i.classList.remove("active");
                }
            });

            item.classList.toggle("active");
        });
    });
    </script>

